  "turns": [
    {
      "input": "*He asks Bartolomhew who they think he is and where he comes from.*",
      "outcome": "success",
      "exception": null,
      "narration": "Bartolomhew tilts his head with the mild curiosity of a man assessing livestock, his paternal smile unwavering. \"Who you are would seem to be none of my business unless you've something to sell or buy,\" he says, his warm voice carrying the easy cadence of long practice. \"As for where you're from, you stand plain enough in West District, Calderan, West, on the known continent.\" He lets the pause stretch, examining Nicco with calm professional interest. \"Though I confess you carry yourself like a man who woke somewhere he didn't expect. Half the debtors in the market have that same lost look, before they learn the lay of things.\"",
